`,(0,n.jsxs)(s,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"I've analyzed the 40 discovery documents and created a detailed analysis document. The chronology spans from contract signing (January 15, 2023) through project termination (June 30, 2024), with 52 key events documented."}),(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Several significant patterns emerged:"})," The scope changed substantially three times during the project, but only the first change was documented with a formal change order. The vendor verbally agreed to the second and third scope expansions in emails (Documents 15, 17, 29) but never provided updated timelines or budgets. Meanwhile, invoices increased 40% beyond the original contract amount."]}),(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"The timeline reveals a pattern:"})," the vendor missed every major milestone by 2-4 weeks, consistently blaming your team for delayed feedback—but our email records show response times averaged 2-3 business days, well within the contract's 5-day requirement."]}),(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"I've organized all findings in the attached document with full citations, making it easy to locate source materials for briefing or settlement discussions."}),(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"View the contract analysis document"})})]}),`
